{"hookSpecificOutput":{"hookEventName":"PreToolUse","permissionDecision":"deny","permissionDecisionReason":"Reflex Control: this command reads `.env`, which holds secrets (matches `.env`); its contents would be sent to the model provider. Use it without reading it, for example `set -a; source .env; set +a` or `--env-file .env`, or ask the user. To allow it, the user can edit `protect.read` in .reflex.toml."}}
